==Battleground==
*8 [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 23.33~33.33 seconds<sup>700f~1,000f</sup>.
*2 [[Those Guys]] spawn after 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>, delay 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 90% HP:
**1 [[Dot Hero]] spawns as the boss.
**8 [[Snache]]s spawn, delay 23.33~26.67 seconds<sup>700f~800f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

